      <activity id="afd9d3e3-1aeb-52ae-95e5-96d2884d01bb" activityNameId="9b3e8a97-c139-5f1a-8650-0f6229bbee6c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium silicate, furnace liquor, 37% in H2O, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium silicate, furnace liquor, 37% in H2O, at plant
data based on a EMPA study, commissioned by the CEES.;
CAS number: 001344-09-8; 
UUID: fbded65b-8a91-31c8-bfa1-5cebb84e4cd5
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium silicate, 37% furnace liquid. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated. The input of compressed air is not reported in the data according to the methodology of the study.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology used from these European producers
Time period: producer information for production year 1995
Production volume: na
Sampling: sampling of questionnaires 
Extrapolations: see included processes
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fbded65b-8a91-31c8-bfa1-5cebb84e4cd5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
